The department conducts scientific research in three main directions:
1) Creation of energy-efficient technologies and equipment in agricultural product processing;
2) Creation of information-communication systems aimed at increasing efficiency in production and economic sectors;
3) Methodologies for ensuring educational quality based on digital technologies in technical education.
It maintains active corporate partnerships for practical training and research with major industrial enterprises such as the Bukhara Oil Refinery, Navoi Mining and Metallurgical Combinat, Navoiyazot, Lukoil Uzbekistan, Shurtan Gas Chemical Complex, Muborak Gas Processing Plant, and Uztelecom.
